# TX

This repo uses TX (`.totality/` present). Do not use `git commit` for normal work.

- Stage: `git add`
- Record: `tx commit -m "…"` (never `git commit`)
- Publish: plain `git push` (pre-push hook runs capture). Do not run `tx push`.
- Open PRs: `gh pr create` (human notes only — do not seed `## Summary`; TX appends below)
- Inspect: `git status`, `git diff`, `git log`, `tx status`

Read the tx skill before any commit, push, or PR.
